      "review": "Exact SDK parsers advance eight bytes for destination in both modes and read the endpoint byte. Group destinations use the low two address bytes, six zero padding bytes and endpoint zero. This 23-byte MT layout resolves the document usage grid (2/8 address bytes, 0/1 endpoint bytes), which disagrees with the source. Direct callbacks drop the ZDO sequence and prepend source address to the response body. No SDK source code is redistributed."
    }
